WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.020 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 15=

01:52.390 --> 01:53.860
Oh, that one.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.020
Excuse me, Honey.

01:56.890 --> 01:57.430
Look.

01:59.220 --> 02:01.860
I saved it in case
the kids needed it in an emergency.

02:06.250 --> 02:07.060
Stop looking.

02:07.060 --> 02:07.890
This is all there is.

02:08.060 --> 02:10.810
I traded liquor coupons for it.

02:12.220 --> 02:12.960
I mean it.

02:13.220 --> 02:13.790
Here.

02:15.510 --> 02:17.150
You don't need the liquor coupons.

02:22.650 --> 02:23.120
Dad.

02:23.340 --> 02:23.820
Mom.

02:24.800 --> 02:26.180
I'll pay you back.

02:26.810 --> 02:28.060
We're family.

02:28.060 --> 02:29.590
What are you saying?

02:30.020 --> 02:31.130
What I'm worried about is

02:31.130 --> 02:32.780
that you spent all the money on lumber.

02:32.970 --> 02:34.500
What about the wedding?

02:35.090 --> 02:36.420
Let's get through this first.

02:40.650 --> 02:41.180
Ting,

02:42.020 --> 02:43.090
what's your plan

02:43.220 --> 02:44.220
once the wood arrives?

02:45.060 --> 02:47.170
I'll find a carpenter
to make the furniture.

02:48.080 --> 02:49.070
A good carpenter

02:49.460 --> 02:50.940
won't be cheap.

02:51.020 --> 02:51.620
True.

02:51.650 --> 02:53.300
But it's cheaper than buying ready-made.

02:56.690 --> 02:57.500
How about this?

02:58.300 --> 02:59.250
Give me the money.

02:59.500 --> 03:00.690
When the wood arrives,

03:00.871 --> 03:01.690
I'll make it for you.

03:03.780 --> 03:05.180
Don't mess around, Fang Muyang.

03:05.250 --> 03:06.370
You know carpentry?

03:06.940 --> 03:07.540
Don't worry.

03:08.160 --> 03:09.010
If I mess it up,

03:09.180 --> 03:10.380
I'll pay you back double.

03:11.020 --> 03:12.650
But I can't do it alone.

03:13.090 --> 03:14.650
I'll need your help, Ting.

03:16.500 --> 03:17.180
Good.

03:17.460 --> 03:18.300
Deal, then.

03:19.500 --> 03:20.340
Consider this money

03:20.500 --> 03:21.620
a wedding gift

03:21.810 --> 03:23.500
from Fei Ni and me.

03:23.893 --> 03:25.404
It's enough for the wedding ceremony.

03:28.690 --> 03:29.500
That won't do.

03:30.004 --> 03:31.220
I can't let you work for free.

03:33.570 --> 03:35.690
We're family.
No need to stand on ceremony.

04:10.700 --> 04:16.740
♪If the future cannot be grasped♪

04:17.540 --> 04:20.740
♪Don't think too far ahead♪

04:20.780 --> 04:24.100
♪Just work hard for today♪

04:25.690 --> 04:26.270
Ting,

04:26.580 --> 04:27.620
strip the bark.

04:28.100 --> 04:28.740
Alright.

04:28.890 --> 04:29.660
I'll try.

04:31.860 --> 04:34.700
♪The ones who smile the most♪

04:34.700 --> 04:36.980
♪Gain the most in return♪

04:38.260 --> 04:41.620
♪I want a life that’s real♪

04:41.700 --> 04:45.060
♪Steady, feet on solid ground♪

04:45.380 --> 04:48.740
♪Slowly, our paths begin to cross♪

04:48.820 --> 04:52.140
♪Each day holds something
to look forward to♪

04:53.300 --> 04:55.810
Liu Cuihua from Building No. 3,
you've got a call.

04:55.820 --> 04:58.700
♪Two people, three meals, four seasons♪

04:59.300 --> 05:02.380
♪Collecting ordinary moments in life♪

05:02.500 --> 05:04.740
♪Making them into memories♪

05:18.370 --> 05:19.860
Stop working. Time to eat.

05:20.250 --> 05:21.660
Take a break. Come and eat.

05:21.660 --> 05:22.420
Right away.

05:23.580 --> 05:26.900
♪A down-to-earth life♪

05:27.300 --> 05:30.540
♪The cloudy days and rain along the way♪

05:30.740 --> 05:33.980
♪As long as I have you,
I'll gladly  endure anything♪

05:34.100 --> 05:37.420
♪Live it real♪

05:37.460 --> 05:41.020
♪Two people, three meals, four seasons♪

05:41.100 --> 05:44.180
♪Collecting sweet moments in life♪

05:44.260 --> 05:46.620
♪Making them into memories♪

05:52.130 --> 05:53.740
Come have some watermelons.

05:53.740 --> 05:54.982
Come on. Have some watermelon.

05:55.210 --> 05:55.690
Fang Muyang.

05:55.690 --> 05:56.690
Take a rest.

05:56.980 --> 05:58.180
Ting, you go ahead.

05:58.180 --> 05:59.210
I'll finish this bit.

05:59.450 --> 06:00.250
Okay.

06:02.860 --> 06:03.410
Hurry up.

06:05.010 --> 06:05.640
Fei,

06:06.180 --> 06:07.070
stop cutting.

06:11.540 --> 06:13.100
Fang Muyang is such a good lad.

06:13.100 --> 06:14.100
He can do everything.

06:14.860 --> 06:16.620
You used to look down on him.

06:16.620 --> 06:17.300
Yeah.

06:18.570 --> 06:20.010
What are you talking about?

06:20.420 --> 06:22.370
You were the one who disliked him.

06:22.540 --> 06:24.370
I was just venting.

06:24.370 --> 06:27.100
I actually liked him a lot.

06:27.100 --> 06:29.180
Oh, sure. You did.

06:30.890 --> 06:31.280
Come on.

06:31.280 --> 06:31.860
Fang Muyang,

06:31.860 --> 06:32.826
have some watermelon.

06:40.450 --> 06:41.500
Don't run.

06:43.540 --> 06:44.890
How dare you steal my whip!

06:45.210 --> 06:45.940
I'm done playing.

06:45.940 --> 06:46.420
Let's go.

06:52.300 --> 06:52.850
Ting,

06:54.060 --> 06:55.180
teach me

06:55.180 --> 06:56.560
how to varnish when you have time.

06:56.604 --> 06:57.130
Sure.

06:58.450 --> 06:59.210
Fang Muyang.

07:00.500 --> 07:02.250
Who taught you carpentry?

07:03.250 --> 07:04.100
Self-taught.

07:04.980 --> 07:06.130
Back at the forest farm,

07:06.130 --> 07:07.300
we had to build our own houses

07:07.500 --> 07:08.860
and make our own furniture.

07:09.250 --> 07:11.100
The educated youth station
had plenty of wood.

07:12.210 --> 07:13.690
If I failed once, I'd try ten times

07:13.860 --> 07:14.660
or twenty times.

07:15.500 --> 07:17.660
I thought we had it tough.

07:17.810 --> 07:19.180
Turns out you had it harder.

07:19.500 --> 07:21.370
We had a roof and food,

07:22.100 --> 07:22.860
that's not rough.

07:26.250 --> 07:27.010
Fang Muyang,

07:27.210 --> 07:28.330
I think I understand now

07:28.330 --> 07:29.370
why Fei Ni likes you.

07:31.570 --> 07:32.370
Why?

07:32.860 --> 07:33.810
You're

07:33.810 --> 07:34.890
like a weed.

07:35.250 --> 07:37.300
No matter where you're thrown,
you grow just fine.

07:38.130 --> 07:38.940
Ting,

07:39.180 --> 07:41.450
that's a pretty special compliment.

07:41.690 --> 07:42.570
I mean it.

07:43.100 --> 07:44.860
A man needs that toughness.

07:44.860 --> 07:46.300
No matter what happens,

07:46.300 --> 07:47.620
we carry it.

07:47.810 --> 07:48.500
True.

07:49.690 --> 07:50.230
Ting,

07:51.250 --> 07:52.450
I really admire you.

07:52.620 --> 07:53.620
Fei Ni said

07:53.810 --> 07:55.180
you were the best farmer

07:55.500 --> 07:57.010
among the educated youths.

07:57.250 --> 07:59.060
Many local farmers asked you for advice.

07:59.660 --> 08:00.690
I'm not bragging.

08:00.890 --> 08:01.770
When it comes to

08:01.980 --> 08:02.690
farming

08:02.690 --> 08:03.500
or cooking,

08:03.660 --> 08:05.500
no one beats me.

08:06.500 --> 08:07.810
But when we farmed,

08:08.060 --> 08:09.660
we hated weeds like you.

08:15.500 --> 08:17.370
Now suddenly I'm handling the writing,

08:18.100 --> 08:19.300
and it feels strange.

08:22.770 --> 08:23.620
I understand.

08:24.226 --> 08:26.100
If we don't know anything, we can learn.

08:26.137 --> 08:27.915
I couldn't make furniture before either.

08:27.915 --> 08:28.804
Look at me now.

08:29.100 --> 08:30.370
Writing is no big deal.

08:30.380 --> 08:32.537
We're youth who survived
in Great Northern Wilderness.

08:32.537 --> 08:33.715
We fight heaven and earth.

08:34.300 --> 08:35.020
That's right.

08:35.380 --> 08:36.420
I have to study hard.

08:36.804 --> 08:38.626
You and Fei Ni went to great lengths

08:38.626 --> 08:39.610
to get me this job.

08:39.900 --> 08:41.090
If I fail it,

08:41.090 --> 08:42.093
I'd disgrace you both.

08:43.971 --> 08:44.780
Ting,

08:46.020 --> 08:47.420
do you have any extra lumber?

08:48.090 --> 08:49.020
Can I take some?

08:49.260 --> 08:50.210
Sure.

08:50.420 --> 08:51.940
Pick the best pieces.

08:51.940 --> 08:53.190
I'll give you as much as I have.

08:53.610 --> 08:54.060
Sure.

08:54.450 --> 08:55.090
Thank you, Ting.

08:55.420 --> 08:56.248
Don't mention it.

09:02.750 --> 09:03.669
A little to your side.

09:03.670 --> 09:04.382
Your side!

09:04.970 --> 09:05.890
No.

09:06.660 --> 09:08.060
Lower it. Lower it on that side.

09:08.060 --> 09:09.610
Be careful, you two.

09:10.610 --> 09:11.210
Wait.

09:11.850 --> 09:12.490
It's too tight!

09:12.490 --> 09:14.020
Use your brain!
You're squeezing my hand.

09:14.026 --> 09:15.300
You're squeezing his hand.

09:15.300 --> 09:17.690
- Easy. It won't fit at all.
- You're squeezing my hand.

09:17.690 --> 09:18.610
Watch out!

09:18.610 --> 09:19.300
Let go.

09:19.300 --> 09:20.660
This won't work.

09:20.660 --> 09:21.870
- Dad.
- We can't lift it in.

09:21.871 --> 09:24.090
Didn't you say you'd hoist it up
through the room beam?

09:24.090 --> 09:25.060
Go ahead and hoist it.

09:26.490 --> 09:28.380
I was just saying.

09:28.810 --> 09:29.730
Fei Ting,

09:29.940 --> 09:30.540
I must say

09:30.540 --> 09:31.660
you're really something.

09:31.660 --> 09:33.060
You said one month,

09:33.060 --> 09:35.570
and here all thirty-six legs are.

09:35.671 --> 09:36.810
You flattered me, Mrs. Lin.

09:36.826 --> 09:38.204
- They're all...
- What do you think?

09:38.204 --> 09:39.950
Fei Ting has pretty
good craftsmanship, right?

09:40.020 --> 09:40.540
Yes.

09:40.540 --> 09:41.300
Very good.

09:41.300 --> 09:43.490
Just like the ones they sell in stores.
Very well made.

09:44.850 --> 09:45.650
Mr. Lin, Mrs. Lin.

09:46.260 --> 09:46.940
You see.

09:47.060 --> 09:49.210
My job is settled,

09:49.490 --> 09:51.450
and the thirty-six legs are all ready.

09:51.850 --> 09:53.090
About our marriage...

09:56.140 --> 09:57.690
I've always felt that

09:57.690 --> 09:59.520
marriage is a major life decision.

09:59.693 --> 10:00.871
It should be taken seriously.

10:03.780 --> 10:04.570
Song,

10:05.090 --> 10:06.420
were you cautious back then?

10:06.900 --> 10:08.760
After you met your wife once
on a blind date,

10:08.760 --> 10:09.610
you were so impatient

10:09.610 --> 10:11.137
and wanted to register the next day.

10:11.182 --> 10:11.582
Mom.

10:11.590 --> 10:13.020
Now you're telling me to be cautious?

10:13.020 --> 10:14.140
- Alright, alright.
- Well.

10:14.260 --> 10:16.060
Your brother doesn't want you to leave.

10:16.060 --> 10:17.090
You're spiky.

10:17.260 --> 10:18.260
I like Fei Ting.

10:18.260 --> 10:19.380
I'm marrying him.

10:20.020 --> 10:21.090
What are you saying?

10:21.090 --> 10:22.260
The neighbors are all here.

10:22.260 --> 10:23.404
Aren't you embarrassed?

10:24.420 --> 10:25.300
Mr. Lin. Mrs. Lin.

10:26.180 --> 10:26.970
Song.

10:27.900 --> 10:30.690
I know you think
I'm not good enough for Lin Mei.

10:31.337 --> 10:32.850
I think I'm not good enough, either.

10:33.570 --> 10:34.380
To me,

10:34.490 --> 10:35.810
she's the best girl.

10:36.850 --> 10:37.690
Forget me,

10:37.900 --> 10:39.570
no one in Jiangcheng deserves her.

10:40.970 --> 10:42.060
Since I'm not good enough,

10:43.060 --> 10:44.300
I'll love her more,

10:44.780 --> 10:45.690
cherish her more,

10:46.490 --> 10:47.693
and listen to her more.

10:48.060 --> 10:49.210
I'll earn more money

10:49.210 --> 10:50.420
and give her more of my pay.

10:51.660 --> 10:52.490
And I'll

10:53.970 --> 10:55.610
have two chubby kids with her.

10:56.810 --> 10:57.900
What are you saying?

10:59.060 --> 11:00.660
Sorry, Mr. Lin, Mrs. Lin. I...

11:00.900 --> 11:02.810
I'm not good with words.

11:03.690 --> 11:04.330
Dad.

11:04.330 --> 11:05.060
Mom.

11:05.060 --> 11:05.690
Brother-in-law.

11:06.115 --> 11:07.300
Please give us your blessing.

11:11.300 --> 11:13.900
We didn't mean to refuse.

11:14.490 --> 11:15.970
If you didn't mean to refuse,

11:16.380 --> 11:17.420
that means you agree?

11:24.715 --> 11:25.850
Our daughter has grown up.

11:26.180 --> 11:27.271
We can't keep her forever.

11:27.690 --> 11:28.490
You...

11:28.693 --> 11:29.826
You decide for yourself.

11:35.330 --> 11:36.690
Your parents are still here.

11:38.940 --> 11:40.300
Hurry up. Move it.

11:42.060 --> 11:42.540
Mom.

11:42.540 --> 11:43.900
Brother-in-law, I'll do it.

11:45.940 --> 11:46.900
Lift.

11:49.660 --> 11:50.490
Well done.

11:52.300 --> 11:53.060
It's going in?

11:54.970 --> 11:55.810
Watch the legs.

11:55.810 --> 11:56.850
Careful with the legs!

11:57.490 --> 11:58.850
Lift.

11:58.850 --> 11:59.540
Right.

12:02.115 --> 12:03.060
About the furniture,

12:03.060 --> 12:04.180
thank you.

12:04.490 --> 12:06.090
I owe you one.

12:06.450 --> 12:07.570
You can make a request.

12:08.810 --> 12:10.060
I actually do have one.

12:10.490 --> 12:11.100
Go ahead.

12:11.690 --> 12:12.180
Wait.

12:12.490 --> 12:14.260
Not like last time.

12:14.450 --> 12:15.660
Don't push your luck.

12:22.020 --> 12:23.420
Where's my bunk bed?

12:23.850 --> 12:24.660
I sold it.

12:25.115 --> 12:26.848
I made this out of your brother's wood.

12:28.810 --> 12:29.300
This...

12:29.610 --> 12:30.870
How are we supposed to sleep?

12:31.900 --> 12:32.780
Fei Ni,

12:32.915 --> 12:34.137
I've analyzed the situation.

12:34.420 --> 12:35.300
The bunk bed

12:35.300 --> 12:36.450
is a hidden danger.

12:37.210 --> 12:37.850
Think about it.

12:38.610 --> 12:40.690
As long as we're not sleeping
in the same bed,

12:40.810 --> 12:42.490
their doubt won't go away.

12:43.900 --> 12:44.690
Besides,

12:45.260 --> 12:46.420
you promised me one request,

12:47.260 --> 12:48.300
didn't you?

12:49.090 --> 12:50.300
This is my request.

12:58.690 --> 12:59.610
Fang Muyang,

13:00.330 --> 13:02.090
we had made a deal.

13:02.260 --> 13:03.570
Don't get any funny ideas.

13:05.260 --> 13:06.660
What funny ideas could I have?

13:09.900 --> 13:10.780
Why don't you try it?

13:11.300 --> 13:12.200
See if it's comfy.

13:36.300 --> 13:37.260
What are you doing?

13:38.970 --> 13:40.020
I'm about to fall.

13:40.782 --> 13:41.826
I need to move in a bit.

13:46.090 --> 13:47.330
Give me back my bunk bed.

13:47.730 --> 13:48.450
Fine.

13:51.380 --> 13:52.330
Lie down first.

13:52.760 --> 13:54.004
Then I'll give it back.

14:04.850 --> 14:05.850
What are you doing?

14:06.300 --> 14:07.090
Don't move.

14:09.380 --> 14:10.380
I might hit you.

14:27.760 --> 14:28.550
What do you think?

14:28.780 --> 14:29.810
The border.

14:35.970 --> 14:38.060
You should've made it taller.

14:38.493 --> 14:40.293
Even if it's taller,
it wouldn't stop me.

14:44.490 --> 14:46.490
I mean, this takes skill.

14:47.300 --> 14:49.090
Look how smooth it is.

14:49.090 --> 14:50.060
There's no splinter.

14:52.690 --> 14:53.900
You did a good job.

14:55.780 --> 14:56.780
There's a handle here.

15:11.490 --> 15:12.690
Is Fei Ni home?

15:15.020 --> 15:16.380
Is Fei Ni home?

15:16.660 --> 15:18.090
Yes. What do you want?

15:18.420 --> 15:19.490
Open the door.

15:21.610 --> 15:22.660
Nope.

15:25.850 --> 15:27.260
I'm not home.

15:32.780 --> 15:33.810
Hey!

15:47.970 --> 15:49.420
Is Fang Muyang home?

16:06.380 --> 16:07.140
Fang Muyang.

16:07.610 --> 16:08.570
Cover your ears.

16:08.570 --> 16:09.380
Don't listen.

16:11.380 --> 16:12.660
Cover your ears.

16:35.060 --> 16:37.730
The groom is here to fetch the bride!

16:40.020 --> 16:42.300
Congratulations!

16:42.300 --> 16:43.210
Dad, Mom.

16:44.090 --> 16:44.850
I'm leaving.

16:45.360 --> 16:45.900
How wonderful.

16:45.900 --> 16:46.490
Look at them.

16:47.300 --> 16:48.210
Dad, Mom, don't worry.

16:48.690 --> 16:49.260
Let's go.

17:03.490 --> 17:06.420
♪Bathed in sunshine♪

17:07.100 --> 17:10.900
♪With lofty ideals in our hearts♪

17:10.900 --> 17:15.290
♪We educated youths go up the mountains
and down to the countryside♪

17:15.290 --> 17:18.690
♪Vowing to unite
with the workers and peasants♪

17:18.690 --> 17:22.900
♪Let our youthful brilliance shine♪

17:36.050 --> 17:36.840
My face is stiff

17:37.380 --> 17:38.690
from smiling all day.

17:39.870 --> 17:41.680
You're happier than Ting
at his own wedding.

17:41.680 --> 17:42.770
You were helping out a lot.

17:42.770 --> 17:43.804
Of course you're tired.

17:43.820 --> 17:45.100
How could I not be happy?

17:45.100 --> 17:46.530
Their problem's finally solved.

17:47.210 --> 17:48.380
Doesn't that mean

17:48.770 --> 17:50.600
half the credit goes to me?

17:51.340 --> 17:52.970
You deserve first-class merit.

17:53.290 --> 17:54.690
But honestly,

17:55.100 --> 17:57.340
ever since I ran into you again
this time,

17:57.340 --> 17:59.340
everything's been good.

17:59.690 --> 18:00.690
Unlike before.

18:03.026 --> 18:04.782
If I said everything
that happened back then

18:04.804 --> 18:05.582
was an accident,

18:06.048 --> 18:07.426
would you believe me?

18:07.700 --> 18:13.180
(Six Years Ago)

18:17.050 --> 18:18.450
Don't you take her things!

18:18.450 --> 18:19.690
I bought that.

18:19.940 --> 18:21.290
Who are you?

18:21.620 --> 18:23.090
My fly!

18:31.140 --> 18:32.250
Stop flying.

18:32.940 --> 18:34.210
Another one.

18:34.490 --> 18:35.690
Get down here.

18:46.271 --> 18:47.340
You're making a scene,

18:47.340 --> 18:48.180
Fei Ni.

18:48.450 --> 18:49.690
Come to my office after class.

18:50.690 --> 18:51.490
Yes.

19:12.490 --> 19:13.690
Fang Muyang!

19:14.010 --> 19:14.420
I...

19:14.660 --> 19:15.260
Uh...

19:18.730 --> 19:19.860
Why is there a tree here?

19:30.226 --> 19:31.480
Are you handing it over or not?

19:31.530 --> 19:32.490
Let go.

19:33.293 --> 19:34.490
I'm not giving it to you!

19:34.490 --> 19:35.210
Give it here!

19:36.140 --> 19:37.160
Let go!

19:38.690 --> 19:39.530
Get off of me!

19:39.530 --> 19:40.620
Let go.

19:42.050 --> 19:42.970
How much?

19:43.580 --> 19:45.010
0.4 yuan.

19:59.970 --> 20:00.820
I'm sorry.

20:03.210 --> 20:04.620
Why are you apologizing?

20:05.250 --> 20:06.580
You didn't know what happened.

20:08.010 --> 20:08.900
Fang Muyang,

20:10.180 --> 20:12.140
sometimes I feel like

20:12.380 --> 20:13.900
I've known you for years.

20:14.140 --> 20:15.970
But sometimes

20:16.420 --> 20:17.940
it feels like I just met you.

20:19.582 --> 20:21.340
Then, on the first day
you truly know me,

20:22.340 --> 20:23.580
would you take a photo with me?

20:25.490 --> 20:26.820
No.

20:27.140 --> 20:28.580
Why waste the money?

20:28.970 --> 20:30.010
It's free.

20:44.290 --> 20:44.930
Fei Ni,

20:45.290 --> 20:46.100
can you see me?

20:46.100 --> 20:46.650
Yes.

20:53.010 --> 20:54.290
What is this?

20:54.290 --> 20:55.180
A gorilla.

20:55.180 --> 20:56.660
Gorilla?

20:56.660 --> 20:57.600
Let me show you this.

20:57.820 --> 20:58.270
Sure.

21:03.010 --> 21:03.900
This is

21:04.900 --> 21:05.820
an ostrich.

21:08.820 --> 21:09.860
That's quite accurate.

21:10.820 --> 21:12.530
Can you do the Young Pioneers salute?

21:12.770 --> 21:13.180
Of course.

21:13.180 --> 21:13.690
Come.

21:13.690 --> 21:14.490
Let's do one.

21:15.340 --> 21:16.940
One, two, three.

21:17.770 --> 21:18.340
Three.

21:23.420 --> 21:26.426
Do you remember when we took
our marriage registration photo?

21:26.626 --> 21:27.820
How about we take another one?

21:28.100 --> 21:28.860
Sure.

21:28.860 --> 21:29.380
Come.

21:33.530 --> 21:35.010
You didn't look like that back then.

21:36.420 --> 21:38.290
Your head should tilt a little.

21:39.010 --> 21:40.490
Turn your shoulder slightly.

21:41.140 --> 21:42.580
I think I didn't turn.

21:44.420 --> 21:44.980
You did.

22:13.210 --> 22:15.640
It's late. I'm going down.

22:41.860 --> 22:43.310
There are so many people

22:43.310 --> 22:44.440
involved in this merger?

22:44.770 --> 22:46.450
Of course.

22:46.970 --> 22:48.380
Besides Jiangcheng University,

22:48.382 --> 22:49.780
there are
Jiangnan Institute of Technology,

22:49.782 --> 22:51.071
Beijing University of Technology,

22:51.130 --> 22:52.493
and Nanjing Normal University.

22:53.140 --> 22:55.880
Quite a crowd
for a small university like Jiangcheng.

22:56.340 --> 22:57.360
That's probably because

22:57.382 --> 22:58.620
Professor Zhou and Professor Wu

22:58.620 --> 22:59.580
made a breakthrough.

22:59.900 --> 23:00.880
Definitely.

23:02.660 --> 23:04.670
I heard you have a younger brother
in Jiangcheng.

23:04.848 --> 23:06.050
Why don't you go visit him?

23:07.310 --> 23:08.440
I'm here to do research,

23:08.690 --> 23:10.190
not visit relatives.

23:10.840 --> 23:11.380
True.

23:11.950 --> 23:14.140
You can even leave
your newlywed husband behind.

23:14.140 --> 23:14.770
Fang Mujing,

23:15.140 --> 23:16.426
I'm really impressed by you.

23:18.870 --> 23:20.050
I'm serious.

23:20.120 --> 23:21.380
I couldn't do it.

23:23.970 --> 23:24.770
Ding Yang,

23:25.340 --> 23:27.120
everyone ranks their life differently.

23:27.620 --> 23:29.220
Maybe our priorities

23:29.220 --> 23:30.550
were never the same.

23:32.293 --> 23:34.380
What's the most important thing
in your life?

23:35.330 --> 23:37.640
I know. It must be research.

23:40.400 --> 23:41.290
They're here.

23:41.300 --> 23:42.860
(Warmly Welcome New Comrades!)

23:45.780 --> 23:49.260
(Jiangcheng University)

23:50.530 --> 23:51.940
- They're here!
- They're here!

23:51.940 --> 23:56.290
- Thank you for coming.
- Thank you for coming.

23:56.290 --> 23:57.770
Hello. Thank you.

23:57.770 --> 24:00.537
- It's a long journey.
- They're here.

24:00.537 --> 24:01.970
- Thank you so much.
- It's a long journey for you.

24:01.970 --> 24:02.530
Careful.

24:02.530 --> 24:03.380
Alright. Thank you.

24:03.380 --> 24:04.010
Good.

24:05.915 --> 24:07.780
(Liu Wei)

24:10.970 --> 24:11.640
Ms. Fang,

24:12.900 --> 24:13.570
long time no see.

24:15.130 --> 24:16.420
Long time no see, Mr. Liu.

24:21.404 --> 24:22.448
This way, please.

24:26.778 --> 24:31.058
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

24:46.770 --> 24:47.260
Fei Ting.

24:47.740 --> 24:48.220
Chief Wang.

24:49.180 --> 24:50.500
There are only a dozen flags.

24:50.760 --> 24:52.382
You've been counting for two hours.

24:54.530 --> 24:55.420
Chief Wang,

24:55.420 --> 24:57.660
I really have nothing else to do.

24:58.330 --> 24:58.990
Last round.

24:59.080 --> 24:59.810
Alright.

24:59.810 --> 25:00.426
Stop counting.

25:00.715 --> 25:02.071
I've got something for you.

25:03.090 --> 25:04.290
Workshop One exceeded

25:04.290 --> 25:05.610
its production target last month.

25:06.226 --> 25:08.950
So the Publicity Department
needs to write a radio interview script.

25:09.370 --> 25:10.220
You'll be

25:10.330 --> 25:11.410
in charge.

25:12.020 --> 25:13.770
Yes, I'll complete the task!

25:13.770 --> 25:14.370
Alright.

25:15.290 --> 25:16.420
But let me be clear.

25:16.420 --> 25:18.210
Our department carries
heavy responsibilities.

25:18.220 --> 25:20.500
Don't drag us down.

25:23.130 --> 25:24.740
And don't embarrass Fei Ni.

25:25.260 --> 25:27.260
Understood. Please rest assured.

25:27.500 --> 25:28.130
I'll do my best.

25:28.740 --> 25:29.420
The reason

25:29.420 --> 25:30.530
Workshop One

25:30.530 --> 25:31.810
was able to complete 130 percent

25:31.810 --> 25:32.826
of its production target

25:32.980 --> 25:35.130
was thanks to everyone's hard work.

25:36.530 --> 25:38.260
All the workers in Workshop One

25:38.260 --> 25:40.330
are not afraid of hardship

25:40.330 --> 25:41.693
and press forward courageously.

25:41.715 --> 25:43.450
That's how we achieved

25:43.900 --> 25:45.180
this small success.

25:49.293 --> 25:49.900
Anything else?

25:50.850 --> 25:51.900
That's all for now.

25:54.860 --> 25:56.900
(Not afraid of hardship. Press forward
courageously. Small success.)

25:57.020 --> 25:58.850
Ms. Liu, maybe

25:59.810 --> 26:01.220
you could add a little more.

26:04.530 --> 26:05.330
Fei Ting,

26:05.940 --> 26:06.530
maybe

26:07.220 --> 26:08.370
you can ask a little more.

26:08.940 --> 26:10.770
What do you want me to ask?

26:10.770 --> 26:13.130
What do you want
to interview about?

26:17.500 --> 26:18.570
Maybe ask about

26:19.020 --> 26:21.610
the outstanding examples
of Workshop One.

26:22.782 --> 26:23.226
Right.

26:23.850 --> 26:24.220
Ms. Liu,

26:24.500 --> 26:25.370
could you tell me

26:25.370 --> 26:26.370
what outstanding examples

26:26.370 --> 26:28.130
have happened in Workshop One?

26:29.700 --> 26:31.980
Speaking of that,

26:31.980 --> 26:33.500
there are plenty.

26:36.050 --> 26:38.180
I won't even mention myself.

26:38.404 --> 26:40.780
Let's talk about the women workers
on the production line.

26:40.980 --> 26:43.740
President Mao once said,
"Women hold up half the sky."

26:43.982 --> 26:45.337
Each and every woman

26:45.360 --> 26:46.982
(Women hold up half...)
in our workshop

26:47.004 --> 26:48.900
is skilled and responsible.

26:48.900 --> 26:49.826
Let me tell you this.

26:49.826 --> 26:51.410
Not only are they technically skilled...

26:54.940 --> 26:56.020
(Overtime)

27:07.700 --> 27:08.500
Ni, you're home.

27:08.570 --> 27:09.110
Ms. Wen.

27:10.180 --> 27:10.770
Ni.

27:12.582 --> 27:14.689
Do you have any idea
what's wrong with your brother?

27:14.690 --> 27:15.826
He came back with a long face.

27:15.826 --> 27:17.160
He barely touched his food

27:17.160 --> 27:18.760
and won't say a word when we ask.

27:19.020 --> 27:20.290
Alright. I'll go check.

27:22.660 --> 27:23.130
Dad.

27:25.570 --> 27:26.740
You're finally back.

27:26.740 --> 27:28.420
Something's wrong with your brother.

27:28.900 --> 27:30.980
The moment I walked in,
he snapped at me.

27:31.180 --> 27:31.810
The work

27:31.810 --> 27:33.700
has driven him crazy.

27:33.700 --> 27:34.260
What's wrong?

27:34.260 --> 27:34.980
I'll take a look.

27:36.404 --> 27:37.180
What are you doing?

27:37.740 --> 27:38.530
I didn't dare

27:38.530 --> 27:40.460
turn up the radio.

27:40.460 --> 27:41.560
I'll go out to listen.

27:45.460 --> 27:45.940
Ting.

27:53.900 --> 27:54.850
Comrade Fei Ting.

27:54.982 --> 27:55.937
Stop messing around.

27:56.420 --> 27:57.220
I'm writing.

27:59.660 --> 28:00.900
(New Blossoms on the Assembly Line)

28:00.900 --> 28:02.330
You've only

28:02.570 --> 28:04.370
written a title?

28:05.700 --> 28:06.130
Ni,

28:07.740 --> 28:09.460
I'm not cut out for writing.

28:09.980 --> 28:11.740
Why don't you talk to Chief Wang

28:11.804 --> 28:12.940
and transfer me to Security

28:13.460 --> 28:14.330
or the cafeteria?

28:15.050 --> 28:17.220
Ting, the Publicity Department
is highly sought-after.

28:17.220 --> 28:18.770
Everyone wants it.

28:18.770 --> 28:20.500
Are you taking it for granted?

28:20.940 --> 28:23.090
I know it's good, but I just

28:23.900 --> 28:25.290
can't do it.

28:25.290 --> 28:26.260
What can you do?

28:26.260 --> 28:27.180
Serving food?

28:27.530 --> 28:28.500
If not for yourself,

28:28.500 --> 28:29.770
at least think about Lin Mei.

28:30.260 --> 28:33.050
Jobs may not be ranked high or low,

28:33.370 --> 28:34.260
but

28:34.260 --> 28:36.370
your mother-in-law
isn't easy to deal with.

28:44.071 --> 28:45.137
If so, I'll learn.

28:45.480 --> 28:46.448
I'll learn how to write.

28:46.537 --> 28:48.382
How is writing an article harder

28:48.382 --> 28:50.370
than harvesting wheat
in the rainy season?

28:50.370 --> 28:51.700
That's more like it.

28:51.700 --> 28:53.915
Ting, writing is simple.

28:53.960 --> 28:56.810
Definitely easier than reclaiming land
in Great Northern Wilderness.

28:56.810 --> 28:58.660
Just remember this.

28:58.660 --> 29:01.382
When writing, don't go straight and flat
like looking at a mountain.

29:01.382 --> 29:02.770
Meaning,

29:02.770 --> 29:05.090
don't be too straightforward.

29:05.090 --> 29:07.050
Let it wind and unfold.

29:07.810 --> 29:08.700
Well.

29:08.700 --> 29:10.090
Since this is your first interview,

29:10.090 --> 29:11.130
I'll draft it for you.

29:16.735 --> 29:17.770
You copy it later.

29:19.810 --> 29:20.460
For example,

29:21.020 --> 29:23.370
if you want to praise Workshop One,

29:23.370 --> 29:25.530
don't praise it directly.

29:25.570 --> 29:26.960
You have to hold it back a little.

29:27.370 --> 29:29.130
That involves another concept,

29:29.850 --> 29:30.740
structure and layout.

29:31.530 --> 29:33.420
There are a few parts
an article should have.

29:33.420 --> 29:33.980
First part,

29:33.980 --> 29:35.370
start with

29:35.530 --> 29:36.610
the workshop director,

29:36.860 --> 29:37.410
Ms. Liu.

29:38.610 --> 29:40.550
Then lead into

29:41.420 --> 29:42.570
the workshop's achievement

29:43.220 --> 29:45.180
of exceeding production targets.

29:45.900 --> 29:48.740
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

29:48.740 --> 29:51.150
"New Blossoms on the Assembly Line.

29:51.460 --> 29:52.040
Dash.

29:52.420 --> 29:56.050
All Staff of Workshop One.

29:57.750 --> 30:01.040
Twenty-six years ago,
at the Founding Ceremony,

30:01.420 --> 30:04.940
when those 'thounderous' words

30:04.940 --> 30:06.850
rang out to the skies...."

30:06.850 --> 30:08.660
Did it make you think of Workshop One?

30:11.660 --> 30:13.740
Why bring in
the Founding Ceremony at all?

30:15.130 --> 30:16.020
Feng Lin,

30:16.290 --> 30:18.020
I actually think
it's quite well written.

30:21.460 --> 30:21.980
Chief Wang,

30:23.570 --> 30:25.610
the Publicity Department

30:25.937 --> 30:27.260
needs to improve its standards.

30:32.515 --> 30:33.515
Who wrote this?

30:34.020 --> 30:35.226
Feng Lin, look.

30:35.248 --> 30:37.370
If you think mentioning
the Founding Ceremony...

30:37.370 --> 30:38.420
Who wrote it?

30:38.850 --> 30:39.740
- Feng Lin.
- I did.

30:42.130 --> 30:42.900
Feng Lin,

30:43.940 --> 30:46.180
I wanted to use the Founding Ceremony
as an introduction

30:46.900 --> 30:49.370
and then lead into
how the Chinese people stood up.

30:50.020 --> 30:51.500
And independence and prosperity

30:51.500 --> 30:53.020
for each individual

30:53.020 --> 30:54.740
means doing one's job well

30:54.740 --> 30:55.980
in one's own position.

30:57.471 --> 30:59.260
So Workshop One
exceeding production targets

30:59.260 --> 31:01.050
and the Founding Ceremony

31:02.982 --> 31:05.115
represent the individual
and the collective,

31:06.090 --> 31:07.330
cause and effect.

31:08.260 --> 31:09.900
They're closely connected.

31:09.900 --> 31:11.580
What is all this nonsense?

31:12.248 --> 31:13.782
Can't you just stick to the facts?

31:14.330 --> 31:16.090
Why drag in all this unrelated matter?

31:16.090 --> 31:18.290
Why not start from the creation
of heaven and earth?

31:18.290 --> 31:19.900
You're out of touch with the people!

31:24.420 --> 31:26.130
Look at these allusions

31:26.130 --> 31:27.300
and these big words.

31:28.020 --> 31:29.370
You're just showing off.

31:30.850 --> 31:33.140
Exactly the same flaw as your sister.

31:37.090 --> 31:37.710
Chief Wang,

31:38.520 --> 31:39.750
I'm not using this piece.

31:40.510 --> 31:41.130
Rewrite it.

31:55.290 --> 31:55.900
Fei Ting.

31:57.740 --> 31:58.220
Maybe

31:59.004 --> 32:00.182
you can revise it again.

32:19.290 --> 32:20.020
You're back.

32:25.700 --> 32:26.330
What happened?

32:37.900 --> 32:39.180
Having trouble at work?

32:40.980 --> 32:41.460
Lin Mei,

32:42.460 --> 32:45.290
I might not last long
in the Publicity Department.

32:46.810 --> 32:47.740
Why?

32:50.530 --> 32:53.850
Was the article Fei Ni wrote for you
no good?

32:55.370 --> 32:56.660
The factory office said

32:57.050 --> 32:58.940
Ni's article

32:58.940 --> 32:59.530
was

33:00.180 --> 33:01.700
all over the place.

33:02.330 --> 33:02.940
They said

33:03.248 --> 33:04.671
it was out of touch with the people,

33:04.740 --> 33:05.693
so they couldn't use it.

33:06.260 --> 33:07.570
I spent all day revising it.

33:08.115 --> 33:09.560
I only changed a few words,

33:10.115 --> 33:11.204
but it still didn't work.

33:13.500 --> 33:14.220
Let me see.

33:15.090 --> 33:16.220
What for?

33:16.220 --> 33:17.271
You wouldn't understand it.

33:17.893 --> 33:20.130
Didn't they say it was
out of touch with the people?

33:20.130 --> 33:21.290
I'm one of the people.

33:21.826 --> 33:23.260
I didn't even finish middle school.

33:23.980 --> 33:25.290
If I can understand it,

33:25.290 --> 33:26.500
then everyone can.

33:27.290 --> 33:27.850
Give it to me.

33:35.330 --> 33:35.810
Up.

33:42.770 --> 33:43.220
Pen.

33:49.610 --> 33:52.560
Look. I don't understand the idiom
in the first sentence.

33:52.560 --> 33:53.460
(Thunderous)

33:53.810 --> 33:54.900
This sentence is too long.

33:54.900 --> 33:55.660
Hard to read.

33:56.090 --> 33:56.480
Cut it.

33:56.780 --> 33:58.604
I don't know
how to pronounce this character.

33:59.090 --> 34:00.100
Or this one.

34:00.130 --> 34:00.500
Cut it.

34:00.671 --> 34:02.448
I don't understand
this whole paragraph.

34:02.980 --> 34:03.620
Hey.

34:04.130 --> 34:04.700
You've deleted

34:04.850 --> 34:05.940
everything.

34:06.220 --> 34:07.610
I can only understand this much.

34:08.020 --> 34:09.610
But I can't just write this little.

34:11.980 --> 34:12.470
Well.

34:12.960 --> 34:14.448
I'll add a few lines for you.

34:22.640 --> 34:26.930
From dawn till dusk,

34:27.420 --> 34:31.940
each drop of sweat
splashes into eight.

34:32.960 --> 34:33.804
That works, right?

34:34.020 --> 34:35.730
Yeah. Keep going.

34:37.090 --> 34:40.130
There's only one goal in their hearts.

34:40.690 --> 34:41.426
That's...

34:41.471 --> 34:44.226
To exceed this month's
production target.

34:44.730 --> 34:45.730
They remind me

34:45.730 --> 34:47.530
of my days in Great Northern Wilderness.

34:47.730 --> 34:49.130
We were the same back then.

34:49.530 --> 34:51.530
Working from dawn till dusk,

34:51.604 --> 34:53.610
bleeding and sweating
but never shedding tears.

34:53.940 --> 34:56.500
Losing skin and flesh
but never falling behind.

34:57.250 --> 34:58.130
Oh!

34:58.530 --> 35:00.790
That was the spirit
of Great Northern Wilderness.

35:01.090 --> 35:05.630
And it's also the spirit
of Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory!

35:17.050 --> 35:17.730
Chief Wang,

35:18.500 --> 35:21.130
the Publicity Department

35:22.071 --> 35:23.737
really needs to improve its standards.

35:25.530 --> 35:26.380
Right, Ms. Xu.

35:27.071 --> 35:28.493
That's what I've been saying.

35:28.730 --> 35:30.900
Fei Ting has already revised
the draft once,

35:30.900 --> 35:31.860
but it's still not good.

35:32.690 --> 35:33.300
Who knows

35:33.300 --> 35:35.582
what standards the Publicity Department
uses to recruit?

35:38.250 --> 35:39.170
He's new.

35:40.020 --> 35:41.340
Of course, he needs guidance.

35:41.940 --> 35:44.570
But he also has to be willing to learn.

35:46.380 --> 35:47.170
As for this draft,

35:47.940 --> 35:49.530
just my personal opinion,

35:49.530 --> 35:51.780
it has no substance and is empty.

35:51.893 --> 35:53.937
There's no literary quality
or depth of thought,

35:54.500 --> 35:55.730
let alone anything profound.

35:57.090 --> 35:58.170
Think about it carefully.

35:58.804 --> 35:59.915
Why was Workshop One

36:00.170 --> 36:02.650
able to exceed its production target?

36:05.250 --> 36:08.300
Because the workers

36:09.020 --> 36:12.250
have a strong sense of collective pride.

36:12.730 --> 36:14.460
They hold deep feelings

36:14.460 --> 36:16.050
for our New China.

36:17.050 --> 36:18.900
It was built on the blood and sacrifice

36:20.020 --> 36:23.210
of countless revolutionary martyrs.

36:24.210 --> 36:24.940
When I say that,

36:25.382 --> 36:26.940
I believe it reminds you of something.

36:32.210 --> 36:34.090
The Founding Ceremony.

36:35.500 --> 36:36.530
This article

36:36.530 --> 36:40.300
could begin with the grandeur
of the Founding Ceremony.

36:40.300 --> 36:43.090
Ms. Xu, well said.

36:43.090 --> 36:45.530
That was actually our original idea.

36:46.300 --> 36:46.860
But...

36:49.115 --> 36:50.915
We were worried that writing it that way

36:51.090 --> 36:53.090
might seem out of touch with the people.

36:53.090 --> 36:54.626
So we revised it into this version.

36:54.980 --> 36:55.650
Fei Ting,

36:55.650 --> 36:57.210
show Ms. Xu

36:57.210 --> 36:58.100
your earlier draft.

36:58.100 --> 36:58.600
Okay.

37:01.610 --> 37:02.320
Ms. Xu.

37:08.940 --> 37:09.640
Good.

37:10.730 --> 37:12.450
This piece is pretty good.

37:13.460 --> 37:14.940
It has thought, substance,

37:15.730 --> 37:17.050
and rich associations.

37:17.515 --> 37:19.248
How is this out of touch
with the people?

37:19.900 --> 37:20.730
The people

37:21.050 --> 37:23.380
also need to improve
their cultural literacy.

37:23.940 --> 37:24.730
Right.

37:24.730 --> 37:26.570
We were being narrow-minded.

37:28.650 --> 37:29.780
However,

37:30.048 --> 37:31.693
there are still
a few uncommon characters

37:32.050 --> 37:33.020
you need to revise.

37:33.782 --> 37:35.420
Once it's revised, no need to show me.

37:35.671 --> 37:37.150
Send it straight to the radio station.

37:37.693 --> 37:39.582
Have it broadcast
during the lunch break.

37:40.730 --> 37:41.210
Yes.

37:47.050 --> 37:48.650
(Twenty-six years ago,)

37:49.210 --> 37:51.090
(when those thunderous words)

37:51.090 --> 37:54.530
(were proclaimed
at the Founding Ceremony,)

37:54.530 --> 37:56.570
(workers at the sewing machine factory)

37:56.570 --> 37:58.020
(were striking with iron hammers,)

37:58.020 --> 38:00.980
(forging the frame)

38:00.980 --> 38:03.530
(of New China's
first industrial sewing machine.)

38:14.050 --> 38:14.530
(Fei Ni,)

38:15.130 --> 38:16.920
(the rooftop is our secret base
from now on.)

38:17.026 --> 38:18.737
(Whenever you see
this arrow pointing up,)

38:18.940 --> 38:20.140
it means we meet up there.

38:50.530 --> 38:51.500
What are you doing?

38:52.050 --> 38:52.730
Fei Ni,

38:52.893 --> 38:54.210
to celebrate your masterpiece

38:54.210 --> 38:55.840
being broadcast
across the whole factory,

38:55.848 --> 38:58.380
I'm treating you
to a Great Northern Wilderness hotpot.

39:00.610 --> 39:02.500
This is a feast.

39:03.160 --> 39:04.648
Back in Great Northern Wilderness,

39:04.730 --> 39:06.248
we used to cook hotpot in heavy snow.

39:06.337 --> 39:07.780
One potato could last us two hours.

39:09.980 --> 39:11.530
Your knife skills are impressive.

39:11.530 --> 39:12.780
So thin.

39:13.130 --> 39:14.460
It takes years of practice.

39:15.940 --> 39:18.050
Besides potatoes,

39:18.050 --> 39:19.315
what else did you eat there?

39:19.360 --> 39:20.570
There wasn't much good food.

39:20.940 --> 39:22.300
Mostly coarse grains,

39:22.300 --> 39:24.130
like sorghum rice and cracked corn.

39:24.471 --> 39:26.448
I couldn't get used to it
when I first got there.

39:26.500 --> 39:27.530
I kept getting the runs.

39:27.530 --> 39:28.360
Later, I adapted.

39:28.420 --> 39:31.293
I just looked forward to holidays
when we could get a bowl of two rice.

39:31.500 --> 39:32.020
Two rice?

39:32.530 --> 39:35.090
Rice mixed with millet
and steamed together.

39:35.730 --> 39:37.090
That's tough.

39:37.090 --> 39:39.210
That must've been torture
for a food lover like you.

39:40.730 --> 39:41.610
That's when you learn

39:41.610 --> 39:43.080
to find joy in hardship.

39:43.848 --> 39:45.560
If we didn't eat coarse grains
every day,

39:45.582 --> 39:47.310
how would we know
how good two rice tasted?

39:47.500 --> 39:49.300
If we had vegetables all year round

39:49.300 --> 39:50.530
and meat regularly,

39:50.530 --> 39:51.860
how could we appreciate

39:51.860 --> 39:53.940
the fun of catching fish
and digging wild greens?

39:53.940 --> 39:56.380
But you said you couldn't catch fish
at the wedding.

39:56.380 --> 39:57.340
That's different.

39:57.604 --> 39:59.630
In Great Northern Wilderness,
we fished in winter.

39:59.848 --> 40:01.893
When the lake froze over,
we'd cut a hole this big.

40:01.915 --> 40:03.820
Sometimes the fish
would jump out on their own.

40:03.820 --> 40:04.780
That big?

40:04.940 --> 40:05.730
That's impressive.

40:05.730 --> 40:07.130
You're making me curious.

40:07.610 --> 40:09.130
Sure. We can go someday.

40:09.420 --> 40:10.020
But for now,

40:10.071 --> 40:12.493
try the cooking of
a Great Northern Wilderness master chef.

40:16.460 --> 40:16.820
Fei Ni.

40:18.940 --> 40:20.820
We should buy two bowls.

40:21.500 --> 40:23.780
We're living together
and don't have proper bowls.

40:28.020 --> 40:28.510
Alright.

40:29.050 --> 40:29.980
I'll buy them tomorrow.

40:32.690 --> 40:33.580
Slice this for me.

40:34.090 --> 40:34.610
Okay.

40:35.940 --> 40:36.770
Carrot top.

40:47.780 --> 40:48.860
To be

40:51.820 --> 40:53.090
or not to be,

40:53.940 --> 40:56.460
that's the question.

40:57.050 --> 41:00.020
Whether it's nobler
in the mind to suffer

41:00.020 --> 41:02.650
the slings and arrows
of outrageous fortune,

41:02.650 --> 41:05.090
or to take arms
against a sea of troubles

41:05.650 --> 41:07.940
and by opposing end them.

41:11.940 --> 41:13.050
To die.

41:15.980 --> 41:17.170
To sleep.

41:18.460 --> 41:19.780
No more.

41:24.690 --> 41:25.820
Brilliant!

41:38.090 --> 41:40.940
Where did you learn that, Fang Muyang?

41:41.340 --> 41:42.090
What did you think

41:42.090 --> 41:43.090
I was skipping class for?

41:43.420 --> 41:44.730
I had to find something to do.

41:45.004 --> 41:47.604
I snuck into the city theater
for a whole year to watch plays.

41:49.090 --> 41:51.340
I've always wanted to ask you something.

41:52.020 --> 41:53.460
You love fooling around so much.

41:53.460 --> 41:55.500
Why did they recommend you
for university?

41:57.420 --> 41:58.210
I don't know.

41:59.650 --> 42:01.340
I never thought about going to college.

42:02.900 --> 42:04.050
I did everything I was asked.

42:05.300 --> 42:06.530
I went to the countryside,

42:06.730 --> 42:07.820
reclaimed the barren lands,

42:08.860 --> 42:09.940
built houses,

42:11.610 --> 42:12.500
and harvested wheat.

42:13.500 --> 42:15.940
And then they recommended me.

42:18.020 --> 42:18.820
And you?

42:19.940 --> 42:21.090
I've never asked.

42:21.090 --> 42:23.690
You were doing fine
at the textile factory.

42:24.026 --> 42:25.804
Why insist on going to university?

42:32.730 --> 42:34.300
I want to major in Chinese Literature.

42:36.460 --> 42:37.610
I want to be a writer.

42:40.130 --> 42:41.300
A writer?

42:41.690 --> 42:42.410
That's good.

42:43.130 --> 42:43.750
Fei Ni,

42:44.130 --> 42:45.820
I've always believed you have talent.

42:46.300 --> 42:48.300
Your dream will come true one day.

42:56.940 --> 42:58.530
I used to think so.

42:59.020 --> 43:01.730
But now...

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
